    "sections": {
        "description": "Stylezen Lite is the free edition of the Stylezen full-site editing (FSE) block theme for WooCommerce-powered fashion and lifestyle stores. It shares the same design language - a ready-made homepage, dedicated shop, product, cart, and checkout templates, a filterable product sidebar, and a sticky/transparent header with mobile pull-out navigation - in a streamlined package. Self-hosted Google Fonts (Lexend, Public Sans) and RTL language support included."
